'AETHER-LOGICAL-CASCADE-ORDER (if not built), AETHER-LOGICAL-VERTICAL (vertical writing modes), AETHER-DIR-PSEUDO-AUTO carried, AETHER-RTL-FLOAT-START-VERTICAL carried.',
